003B0A  1               ;
003B0A  1               ;	WRITE CHARACTER(A) TO UART
003B0A  1               ;________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
003B0A  1               ;
003B0A  1               WRSER1:
003B0A  1  48                   PHA
003B0B  1               WRSER1a:
